                    },
                    "description": {
                      "value": "You're surrounded by a palpable sense of menace and power that's terrifying to behold. The aura is a 15-foot emanation. An enemy that enters or ends its turn in the aura must attempt a Will save against the higher of your spell DC or class DC.\n\n- **Success:** The creature is unaffected and temporarily immune to your Frightful Aura for 1 minute.\n- **Failure:** The creature is frightened 1.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature is frightened 2."
